---
// 替代原 React 版 HeadGradient：纯 div + CSS animation 淡入（原 framer-motion opacity 0→1）。
---

<div
  class="head-gradient absolute -z-1 top-0 inset-x-0 h-[350px] bg-gradient-to-r from-accent/5 to-accent/15"
  style="mask-image: linear-gradient(black, transparent)"
>
</div>

<style>
  .head-gradient {
    animation: head-gradient-in 0.6s ease-out;
  }
  @keyframes head-gradient-in {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }
</style>
